OL,3,GNEWSAVisiting fans thanked by police
OL,4,Aafter walk to game
OL,5,
OL,6,FVisiting supporters who marched through
OL,7,FBournemouth before the club's first
OL,8,FEuropean home fixture have been thanked
OL,9,Fby police for their conduct.
OL,11,FFans of Austrian side Sturm Graz were
OL,12,Faccompanied by police as they walked
OL,13,Fen-masse through the seaside town to
OL,14,Fthe Vitality Stadium on Thursday
OL,15,Fevening.
OL,17,FDorset Police deployed more than 150
OL,18,Fofficers to the Europa League clash -
OL,19,Fthe first European home game in AFC
OL,20,FBournemouth's 127-year history.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
