OL,3,GNEWSAVisiting fans thanked by police
OL,4,Aafter walk to game
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the fan walk the force said
OL,7,Fofficers appreciated the cooperation of
OL,8,Fthe away fans "as we worked hard to
OL,9,Fkeep any disruption to the local
OL,10,Fcommunity to a minimum".
